# The build context is uploaded to Fly's remote builder before the Dockerfile runs. The relay
# Dockerfile (deploy/Dockerfile) copies ONLY Cargo.toml, Cargo.lock, and core/rust — so exclude
# everything heavy or irrelevant here to keep the upload small (MBs, not the multi-GB target/) and
# deploys fast. Do NOT add Cargo.toml, Cargo.lock, core/rust, or deploy/ — the build needs them.
.git/
target/
**/target/
node_modules/
**/node_modules/
ui/
site/
docs/
build/
dist/
.wrangler/
.venv/
__pycache__/
**/__pycache__/
*.log
*.tmp
*.pyc
.ai-participant/
logo-previews/
fuzz/
